            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daxta gár afhhamít a kuungá' masók an hotá' ar adoodá' Ya/abtór Kristo kawa hariím. Án barnaxes naa hardáh amorhúng, laqaá barnaxes naa hardihiiká, gár án ni slaa' masók an axaás adór kuungá' tara sihhitano hhe'esé' baraá haratlintaaoro ar wakleeli'iimár baraá Qeeru, nee haratlintaaór Ya/abtór hho' kawa aleeslaqwa' ar muunuú wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakuuserhúng ma da'ayuumitaara' baraá umuúqo gaaro. Kuungá' bar pihh'uumár koondá', gaarí a laya dir'ine ar inooín iwa qwaariya'. Ala dirhunge a laya adór kuungá' tar ba/aandá'. Nee layaarí amór i dahh a amór Mungú inósuú kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' qeemu ugwa sleeré' oo Kristo kuwa haratlintié'. Ala a har qeemuuwí kiloseeká, ala tunduna slahh'eemiís sleeme as inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' sleeme a slaqwá' baraá slaqwaraarí aníng ni slaqwa. Kuungá' aáng aníng iga aandé', niwa slaáqw, nee hamí aga axasé' adór aníng nir kumiít slaqwaraarihe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
